@startuml F0.1-b-primeiro-acesso
title F0.1-b — Login → primeiro acesso (mustChangePassword)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "LoginUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: credenciais / Entrar
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/login
AuthController -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario BY identificador
Postgres --> UC: usuario (senha_alterada=false)
UC -> UC: Argon2id.verify OK
UC -> Postgres: INSERT refresh_token\nINSERT audit_log (iam.login_success)
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> AuthController: LoginResult\n(mustChangePassword=true)
AuthController --> WebApp: 200 + accessToken + flag

note right of WebApp
  Token válido para /primeiro-acesso
  Bloqueia /inicio e demais rotas
  RN-F0.1-04
end note

WebApp --> Usuario: redireciona /primeiro-acesso

@enduml
